{
  "id": "myriad_ecology",
  "title": "Building Ecology",
  "item": "omnira:crystal_ball",
  "text": [
    "Select Ecology and insert one microcore. Construction clears every block inside the sphere, including unbreakable blocks.",
    "One biome is drawn uniformly from the microcore’s pool. All pools exclude the Spacetime Mirror Corridor.",
    "Ground or liquid fills the lower third of the sphere. A treasure orb appears at the center, enclosed with the landscape in a single layer of Spiritual Crystal. The surrounding biome stays the same.",
    "Landscapes are built from biome blocks, liquids and suitable decorations rather than copied buildings or inventories. Treasure uses the related biome/dimension loot table. Pure Solidified Spacetime is replaced with Excited Rough Spatial Crystal in these landscapes."
  ],
